OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity scheme to help firms
OL,4,A'adopt robotics'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA West Yorkshire university has
OL,7,Freceived funding for a
OL,8,Fmultimillion-pound robotics project to
OL,9,Fhelp companies use the technology to
OL,10,Fexpand their businesses.
OL,12,FThe #3.67m Yorkshire Robotics Hub in
OL,13,FBradford is hoping to bridge the
OL,14,F"automation gap", the city's university
OL,15,Fsaid, and has been partially funded by
OL,16,Fgovernment body Innovate UK.
OL,18,FThe University of Bradford said the
OL,19,Fprogramme would help businesses "adopt
OL,20,Frobotics and automation technologies",
OL,21,Fworking with more than 300
OL,22,Fmanufacturers.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
