OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity scheme to help firms
OL,4,A'adopt robotics'
OL,5,
OL,6,FProfessor Sherif El-Khamisy, the
OL,7,Funiversity's Pro-Vice-Chancellor for
OL,8,FResearch, Innovation and Global
OL,9,FEngagement, said the project was not
OL,10,Faiming to reduce human jobs.
